            "detailed_description": "Descobre a mistura feroz de &quot;Warriors&quot; e &quot;Berserk&quot;!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/b6bc1fdf9cc198c3f30386a2b73ac08d.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=370 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/2227e594f0111524a80554bcb1015375.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=820 /></span><br><br>Neste jogo, a ação de desbastar centenas de inimigos fundamental da série Warriors é fundida com a atmosfera negra e violenta do mundo de &quot;Berserk&quot;, o que torna possíveis várias ações nunca antes vistas como usar uma espada do tamanho de um homem para cortar inimigos ao meio bem como esmagá-los ou lançá-los pelo ar com as ações &quot;Slash&quot; e &quot;Smash&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/3b372679526e1193bfbb32f7df11cacc.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/9402644197c31db2a10558858a4e87a2.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/41918663f27920fd5140c75989e64dc4.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/b51731963da9ccda2ff63265cedc081c.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br>História:<br>Para além da história já conhecida, &quot;The Golden Age Arc&quot;, também poderás juntar-te a Guts na sua viagem de vingança através de &quot;The Hawk of the Millennium Arc&quot;. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/b547d002f45198d02ca403cc5f56c6ca.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/e36b4bd4be2f1a714e030ec1fafff2d4.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/454cb1b61e69ba11be744b1c9c2449c9.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/b59285770783ae827b98bbc7d3d2958b.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br>Personagens:<br>Para além de Guts, o herói principal, existem várias personagens com que podes jogar. <br>Além disso, foi convidado a participar o mesmo elenco familiar de atores japoneses da trilogia de filmes e da nova série de animação.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/5118adc964be013be72383827980251c.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/c742acf7a41489a7fba88f5a9994b104.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/cf333c54a0ffd327b17cf255f1c657fa.avif?t=1760594951\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/502280/extras/96